OL,3,GNEWSAOfsted a major factor in school
OL,4,Achoices, report
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents are influenced by Ofsted
OL,7,Freports when choosing a primary school
OL,8,Ffor their children, with families
OL,9,Fabandoning schools given poor reports,
OL,10,Fresearch has found.
OL,12,FDr Ellen Greaves, economics lecturer
OL,13,Ffrom the University of Exeter, analysed
OL,14,Fdata from the Department for Education.
OL,16,FShe found a good report led to a 5%
OL,17,Fincrease in the number of parents
OL,18,Fchoosing a school while a poor report
OL,19,Fled to an 11% drop, and was enough for
OL,20,Fsome parents to rule a school out all
OL,21,Ftogether.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
