OL,3,GNEWSAOfsted a major factor in school
OL,4,Achoices, report
OL,5,
OL,6,FParent Chloe said inspection ratings
OL,7,Fwere frequently discussed by parents
OL,8,Fwhen discussing school options."We
OL,9,Fwouldn't send our children anywhere
OL,10,Fthat had a bad Ofsted review," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
